; HAPPY VALLEY greybox metatiles (16x16) on harness/common/greybox.tiles: the oval tracks
; (res/maps/*.map, generated by design/gen_track.py). Art replaces them at the end.
@ tileset greybox
@ base auto
@ attr SOLID 0x80

GROUND   BLANK  BLANK  BLANK  BLANK
TURF     FLOOR  FLOOR  FLOOR  FLOOR
DIRT     GRAY   GRAY   GRAY   GRAY
RAIL     BOX    BOX    BOX    BOX
INFIELD  DOT    BLANK  BLANK  DOT
STAND    CHECK  CHECK  CHECK  CHECK
CITY     SOLID  SOLID  SOLID  SOLID
FINISH   DOOR   DOOR   DOOR   DOOR
